        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a553"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1018" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1020">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Dakosh said that Ayana left for the lager' on the first [of August.]</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a574"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1022" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1030">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Then I thought maybe Gulzhanat went there too because she usually attends such school events. </ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a557"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1042" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1050">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>She will probably change jobs in that place, right? Maybe she'll get a job in an area closer to her new house?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
    </TIER>
